# Generated BFF Dart client lockfiles.
# pubspec.lock here is produced by `flutter pub get` (via
# scripts/generate-bff-types.sh), NOT by the version-pinned OpenAPI codegen.
# It resolves transitive Dart dev-deps (test, test_api, test_core) against the
# live pub.dev registry, so it floats with upstream patch releases independently
# of the Zod source. It is excluded from scripts/verify-parity.sh; keeping it
# untracked stops non-deterministic churn from re-entering the parity surface.
pro/packages/formulaeapps_bff_client/pubspec.lock
community/packages/formulaeapps_bff_client/pubspec.lock
